{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53H44EDAJKHWDDB7FTT68","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インスタにも載せましたが、イオンカードさんのパネルを見にいってきました☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グッズやファンクラブの列に並んでる皆さんを見ながら、こっそりと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も朝早く行ったのですが、私よりはやくきてくださっている方もいて、すっごく嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてくれた子ありがとう☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして愛知公演に足を運んでくださった皆さん本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったー！！！\nその一言につきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーで初めておじゃましてから愛知が大好きになりました。\n行けてよかった☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またプライベートで遊びに行きますね！\nぜったい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三期生多めのオフショット載せます。\nみんな撮ってくださいと言いにきてくれたんです。可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53J5QAEVHEZ78CM3KPAC6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みう。\nみうとゆうは呼び捨てで呼ぶと約束しました。\nじみーに空気感が似てると思ってる。\n目が合うと笑ってくれます☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53K813D1YTM8D6NHDCX0R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆう。\n1日目にみうと2人で話しかけにきてくれました。\nさみしいと伝えてくれるふたりです。\n可愛いなー☺︎\nわんちゃんのおすすめ動画を教えました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53M7W8G1QZHQNQ3VZQ2DY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいりちゃん。\n私が他の三期生の子と写真撮ってる間うろうろしながら待っててくれたみたいです。\n小動物みたいで愛でたくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53NP7QXAYY6BF4WW923C7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りかちゃん。\n三期生のおねえさん。\n私も20歳で入ったから同じだねーってお話ししました。\nりかちゃんらしくのんびり過ごして欲しいなー☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53PP81F0G3GF7J6MQZAE2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーづちゃん。\n面白いゆーづちゃん。\nスープを切なそうに飲むのが本当に可愛いです（笑）\nMCもこなしててすごいなーと思っています☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53QPW478G1RX0SP593RSZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもりたひかるちゃん！\n急に二期生！\nもりたひかるちゃん大好きだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53RRG50ASGEBMXEHZRXPQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まつだりなちゃん！\nまつだりなちゃんも大好きだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです。\n写真いっぱい撮れて嬉しい☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてお花もありがとうございます☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53SSA426974DEK5JBJHG0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53TSZB6AENNXDRKY0YPFK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53VTA8FCPMBYNX3D7F9HH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53WT79J48J8V2X6JZH3C0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53XT54G1B3Q2Q4FS5VBSS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH53YRE80EZRPH5TQBHYAXB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に私の卒業セレモニーを福岡公演最終日に開催させていただけることになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと皆さんに言いたかったのでこうやってお知らせできて嬉しいです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ楽しみにしててください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、今日はここまでです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関有美子🐱"}],"source":"archive"}